  "description": "The VELOCI OLD STREET V1.1 continues the fast and responsive ride feel of the original while adding a number of practical updates for modern single speed, fixed gear, and tracklocross riding.\n\nBuilt around the same proven geometry, OLD STREET keeps the direct handling and playful character that works equally well for city riding, aggressive commuting, weekend tracklocross events, or simple everyday riding.\n\nOne of the main updates is the revised internal brake cable routing system. The new interchangeable cap design replaces the traditional brass inner tube setup, helping reduce weight while also improving water protection when running the frame brakeless.\n\nTire and mud clearance have also been increased on both the frame and fork, now fitting up to 35c tires. The extra space improves versatility and makes the bike more capable on rough roads, gravel paths, and cyclocross-style riding conditions.\n\nOLD STREET is built around the idea of a modern multipurpose track bike — simple, fast, adaptable, and fun to ride almost anywhere.",
